### Ingest ERROR signal
POST http://localhost:8080/signals
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "serviceName": "payment-service",
  "environment": "local",
  "signalType": "ERROR",
  "severity": "HIGH",
  "message": "Payment provider timeout",
  "correlationId": "req-123",
  "traceId": "trace-123",
  "spanId": "span-123",
  "latencyMs": 2400,
  "statusCode": 504,
  "errorCode": "PAYMENT_TIMEOUT",
  "timestamp": "2026-05-02T10:15:00Z",
  "attributes": {
    "provider": "mock-payment-provider",
    "endpoint": "/payments/charge"
  }
}

### List recent signals
GET http://localhost:8080/signals?limit=10


### Get signal by id
GET http://localhost:8080/signals/8a53a039-cfcb-49ab-a2d3-73fd3b6c8997